  "hub_copy_before": "THE FAMILY HUB VISION Health gets easier when the family can move in the same direction. The growing ReVitalized digital ecosystem is being designed with family participation in mind\u2014bringing coaching, education, healthy routines, progress and resources into a more connected experience. The individual still matters. A family approach should make it easier to support one another without assuming that everyone needs the same priorities. \u2713 Shared healthy rhythms Make the home environment part of the solution. \u2713 Age-appropriate participation Help younger family members understand healthy choices. \u2713 Individual priorities Keep personalized needs from getting lost in a family plan. \u2713 Family encouragement Build consistency through support instead of isolation.",
